VCR OSD Mono font

The author (Riciery Leal) [1] has mentioned that the font is free for
non-commercial use [2] as well, with no additional remarks.

Asked directly whether commercial use was permitted, the author answered in
the font's own comment thread [2]:

    mrmanet  author of VCR OSD Mono   Feb 24, 2017
    Yes, the font is free even for commercial purposes.

So the grant is for any purpose, commercial and non-commercial alike, with no
conditions attached. There is no separate licence document to quote: this file
is the record of the terms, and the sources below are where they were stated.


Sources
1. https://aur.archlinux.org/cgit/aur.git/tree/PKGBUILD?h=ttf-vcr-osd-mono
2. https://www.dafont.com/font-comment.php?file=vcr_osd_mono
